{"title":"oWarps Parasites","pages":[{"title":"oWarps Parasites","lines":["Warps Parasites firmware","(Matthias Puech) on the","original Warps DSP, 96 kHz.","","Knob 1 MIX, knob 8 MODE.","Knobs 2-7: the mode's","own controls (page shows","only the active mode).","Jog: Settings page."]},{"title":"Modes","lines":["DOPPLER  X Y LFO RT LFO AM","  ROOM: tiny..huge","WAVEFOLDER FOLD BIAS","CHEBYSCHEV ORDER GAIN","FREQ SHIFT SHIFT UP/DN","  FDBK DRY/WT CARR","BIT MANGLER DEGRD XMOD","COMPARATOR COMPAR ORDER","VOCODER WARP RELEAS","DELAY SPEED DIST FDBK","  DRY/WT TOPO","META ALGO TIMBRE"]},{"title":"Oscillator","lines":["OSC (knob 6) EXT = input 1","is the carrier. SINE/TRI/","SAW (vocoder SAW/PULSE/","NOISE): internal carrier,","input 1 phase-modulates it.","Knob 4 becomes PITCH.","Settings PITCH=MIDI: notes","on the track set the pitch."]},{"title":"Delay","lines":["SPEED: +100 forward, 0 stop,","- reverse. DIST: head gap.","TOPO: OPEN LOOP (AUX fed","back to IN 2 internally),","DUAL, ANALOG (filtered,","hiss), PING-PONG."]},{"title":"Settings","lines":["ROUTE: DUAL L>in1 R>in2,","MONO, CARRIER (mono>in2,","in1 open), PRESERVE (one","Warps per channel).","OUTPUT: MAIN+AUX or MAIN.","DC CUT: like the module's","AC-coupled outputs."]}]}
